    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a practical, hands-on approach to math, focusing on real-world applications like budgeting and data analysis. My vocational diploma taught me problem-solving skills that I apply daily, but I prefer math that connects to creativity—like using it in photography or gaming. I don’t see it as abstract theory but as a tool for making sense of the world.",
