    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used AI tools like Khan Academy’s chatbot to check my budget calculations and solve basic algebra problems. It was helpful for quick verification but not for complex topics. I found it great for reinforcing concepts I understood well, but I still preferred hands-on practice with real-world examples to build deeper intuition.",
